whichever is higher, plus any EMI instalments on the card. Paying at least the minimum amount due by the due date avoids the late payment fee, but interest is still charged on the unpaid balance.\"}]}"}}],"status":{"code":1},"parentSpanId":"07656389779c3cc3"}
